index fbec307..af2949b 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -88,3 +88,21 @@ src/
 ```
 
 Rename the product in `src/lib/config.js`.
+
+## Demo persistence and checks
+
+Run `npm ci`, `npm test`, `npm run lint`, and `npm run build`.
+
+Log in with a demo account before sending enquiries. New enquiries, chat messages,
+brand-side demo signatures and creator prices persist in this browser. Switch to
+the creator demo account in the same browser to see enquiries for c1. The sponsor
+dashboard only lists that demo sponsor's deals. These are UI restrictions, not
+server-side authentication: do not use this prototype for real customer data.
+
+Contract and package-summary endpoints accept validated browser-owned snapshots.
+They use selected prices and rights; they do not infer negotiated terms from chat.
+Production must replace this with authenticated database lookups and confirmation
+by both parties. Reviews and performance remain fixed demo results.
+
+Creator registration edits the existing c1 demo profile; it does not create a new
+account or verify YouTube ownership. Clearing site storage resets the demo.
